 irs. When attending trade fairs\, applicants with childcare responsibiliti
 es can request up to CHF 250 per week for childcare or children's travel e
 xpenses. No application fee.\nDuration: Six-month mentoring programme\, ap
 proximately 30 hours total commitment\; notification in November 2027\; ea
 rliest project start 1 January 2028. Next application window 1 July to 1 S
 eptember 2027.\n\nMore: https://prohelvetia.ch/en/find-support/game-design
